#20200
Credits for Blackheart Keep~
    This area was created with the Knight and Death Knight classes in mind.
Hopefully, Blackheart Keep will give good-aligned knights a place to kill 
evil mobs, and Death Knights and evil warriors a place for some good EQ.  I 
have also included some nice little items for Assassins, Thieves, Clerics, 
and even Good Knights.  Most items are evil, but there are a couple of 
rewards for those few good Knights who would brave the dangers of the castle 
and attempt to wipe-out the evil of this place...or something like that.

A few of the names used are from Arthurian Legend and the AD&D Deities &
Demigods book.

Smythe
Summer 1995
Revised Feb '96
~
202 8 0 0 0 0 255 0
S
#20201
Before the Ruins~
You see before you the remains of a once great fortress.  It looks like
a combination of several earthquakes and raids have reduced most of it
to rubble.  Directly to the north, you see the crumbled gates and rusted
portcullis.
~
