#20203
Overgrown Courtyard~
Piles of rock and rotting wood clutter the courtyard.  The path through
the tall grass leads in all four directions from here.  To the north you
see the remains of the inner keep of the fortress, South is the crumbled
gatehouse, east and west you see more grassy courtyard.
~
