#20205
Entrance of the Inner Keep~
As you look around the inner keep, you realize just how large this castle
must have been.  Above, you can see the rotting floorboards of the several
upper storeys that once made up the keep.  Across the great hall to the
north, you can see where centuries of earthquakes and mudslides have
buried at least half of the inner keep.
~
