#20239
Battlements of Bridge-tower.~
A ballista sits here, pointed down at the road leading south toward the
mountain.  The view here is breathtaking.  As you look to the north, you
can see the deep chasm over which the rope bridge extends as it connects
this tower to an identical one on the other side.  Also to the north lies
Blackheart Keep.  East and west, the view is of mountain tops and deep
canyons.
~
