#20244
Battlements of Bridge-tower.~
A ballista sits here, pointed down at the bridge leading south across the
Chasm.  The view here is breathtaking.  As you look to the south, you
can see the deep chasm over which the rope bridge extends as it connects
this tower to an identical one on the other side.  To the north lies
Blackheart Keep.  The view of the Keep doesn't match the name at all. It is
actually quite majestic.  Situated on an island of rock among the clouds,
the walls of the keep are clean and shine white in the sun.  Several sky-blue
flags fly over the towers and walls of the keep.  In the center of the Keep,
you see the standard of Lord Skul...A black heart on a sky-blue background.
~
